000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. CLMINQ0.
000300 AUTHOR. CORVANE CLAIMS SYSTEMS.
000400*================================================================
000500* CLMINQ0  CLAIMS INQUIRY (CICS)                 TRANSACTION CLMI
000600*
000700* PSEUDO-CONVERSATIONAL. FIRST ENTRY SENDS AN EMPTY MAP CLMINQM
000800* (MAPSET CLMINQS). THE ADJUSTER KEYS A CLAIM NUMBER; THE PROGRAM
000900* READS VSAM FILE CLMMAST (CORV.CLMMAST, COPY CLMREC) AND SHOWS
001000* STATUS, LOSS DATE, RESERVE, PAID, FRAUD SCORE AND ADJUSTER.
001100* A FRAUD SCORE ABOVE 0.720 IS SHOWN BRIGHT WITH "REFER" - THE
001200* SAME CUT-OFF AS fraud-scoring REFER_THRESHOLD (ADR-0011 SAYS
001300* 0.80; THE CODE IN BOTH PLACES SAYS 0.72).
001400* BEING REPLACED BY claims-service GET /v1/claims/{id}/summary
001500* (STRANGLER, ADR-0010). READ-ONLY: NO UPDATES FROM THIS SCREEN.
001600* PF3 = EXIT, ENTER = INQUIRE.
001700*================================================================
001800 DATA DIVISION.
001900 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002000     COPY CLMREC.
002100     COPY CLMINQS.
002200     COPY DFHAID.
002300     COPY DFHBMSCA.
002400 01  WS-RESP                     PIC S9(08) COMP.
002500 01  WS-CLAIM-KEY                PIC X(14).
002600 01  WS-REFER-THRESHOLD          PIC 9V999 VALUE 0.720.
002700 01  WS-EDIT-AMT                 PIC Z(9)9.99-.
002800 01  WS-EDIT-SCORE               PIC 9.999.
002900 01  WS-DATE-OUT.
003000     05  WS-DD                   PIC X(02).
003100     05  FILLER                  PIC X(01) VALUE '/'.
003200     05  WS-MM                   PIC X(02).
003300     05  FILLER                  PIC X(01) VALUE '/'.
003400     05  WS-CCYY                 PIC X(04).
003500 01  WS-DATE-IN                  PIC X(08).
003600 01  WS-COMMAREA                 PIC X(01) VALUE 'C'.
003700 LINKAGE SECTION.
003800 01  DFHCOMMAREA                 PIC X(01).
003900 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
004000 0000-MAIN.
004100     IF EIBCALEN = ZERO
004200         PERFORM 1000-FIRST-TIME
004300     ELSE
004400         EVALUATE EIBAID
004500             WHEN DFHPF3
004600                 PERFORM 9000-EXIT
004700             WHEN DFHENTER
004800                 PERFORM 2000-INQUIRE
004900             WHEN OTHER
005000                 MOVE 'INVALID KEY - USE ENTER OR PF3' TO MSGO
005100                 PERFORM 8000-SEND-DATAONLY
005200         END-EVALUATE
005300     END-IF
005400     EXEC CICS RETURN TRANSID('CLMI')
005500               COMMAREA(WS-COMMAREA) LENGTH(1)
005600     END-EXEC.
005700 1000-FIRST-TIME.
005800     MOVE LOW-VALUES TO CLMINQMO
005900     MOVE 'ENTER A CLAIM NUMBER AND PRESS ENTER' TO MSGO
006000     EXEC CICS SEND MAP('CLMINQM') MAPSET('CLMINQS')
006100               FROM(CLMINQMO) ERASE
006200     END-EXEC.
006300 2000-INQUIRE.
006400     EXEC CICS RECEIVE MAP('CLMINQM') MAPSET('CLMINQS')
006500               INTO(CLMINQMI) RESP(WS-RESP)
006600     END-EXEC
006700     IF CLMNOL = ZERO
006800         MOVE 'CLAIM NUMBER IS REQUIRED' TO MSGO
006900         PERFORM 8000-SEND-DATAONLY
007000     ELSE
007100         MOVE CLMNOI TO WS-CLAIM-KEY
007200         EXEC CICS READ FILE('CLMMAST')
007300                   INTO(CLM-RECORD)
007400                   RIDFLD(WS-CLAIM-KEY)
007500                   RESP(WS-RESP)
007600         END-EXEC
007700         EVALUATE WS-RESP
007800             WHEN DFHRESP(NORMAL)
007900                 PERFORM 3000-SHOW-CLAIM
008000             WHEN DFHRESP(NOTFND)
008100                 MOVE LOW-VALUES TO CLMINQMO
008200                 MOVE 'CLAIM NOT FOUND' TO MSGO
008300             WHEN OTHER
008400                 MOVE 'CLMMAST UNAVAILABLE - TRY LATER' TO MSGO
008500         END-EVALUATE
008600         PERFORM 8000-SEND-DATAONLY
008700     END-IF.
008800 3000-SHOW-CLAIM.
008900     MOVE CLM-NUMBER        TO CLMNOO
009000     MOVE CLM-POL-NUMBER    TO POLNOO
009100     MOVE CLM-STATUS        TO STATO
009200     MOVE CLM-LOSS-CAUSE    TO CAUSEO
009300     MOVE CLM-ADJUSTER-ID   TO ADJO
009400     MOVE CLM-CLAIMANT-NAME TO CLMTO
009500     MOVE CLM-LOSS-DATE     TO WS-DATE-IN
009600     MOVE WS-DATE-IN(7:2)   TO WS-DD
009700     MOVE WS-DATE-IN(5:2)   TO WS-MM
009800     MOVE WS-DATE-IN(1:4)   TO WS-CCYY
009900     MOVE WS-DATE-OUT       TO LOSSDTO
010000     MOVE CLM-RESERVE-AMT   TO WS-EDIT-AMT
010100     MOVE WS-EDIT-AMT       TO RESVO
010200     MOVE CLM-PAID-AMT      TO WS-EDIT-AMT
010300     MOVE WS-EDIT-AMT       TO PAIDO
010400     MOVE CLM-FRAUD-SCORE   TO WS-EDIT-SCORE
010500     MOVE WS-EDIT-SCORE     TO FRAUDO
010600     IF CLM-FRAUD-SCORE > WS-REFER-THRESHOLD
010700         MOVE DFHBMBRY TO FRAUDA
010800         MOVE 'REFER - FRAUD SCORE ABOVE 0.720' TO MSGO
010900     ELSE
011000         MOVE DFHBMPRO TO FRAUDA
011100         MOVE SPACES TO MSGO
011200     END-IF.
011300 8000-SEND-DATAONLY.
011400     EXEC CICS SEND MAP('CLMINQM') MAPSET('CLMINQS')
011500               FROM(CLMINQMO) DATAONLY
011600     END-EXEC.
011700 9000-EXIT.
011800     EXEC CICS SEND TEXT FROM('CLAIMS INQUIRY ENDED')
011900               LENGTH(20) ERASE FREEKB
012000     END-EXEC
012100     EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
